// [DRAFT] D571 — the City Gates guards in passing (D338). Not wired yet: the guard is not an NpcBase
say|GATE_GUARD|Keep your eyes down, little one. Nobody here looks at the sky.
say|GATE_GUARD|Are you shaking, or is that just sand rustling on you?
say|GATE_GUARD|We guard the gate. What hangs above it, nobody guards.
exit|
